      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A stock carved of enchanted wood forms the base for a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "musket staff",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", a magic weapon used by a gunwitch as both a powerful firearm and magical staff. Many other variants exist with different spells. This "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+1 flintlock musket",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " has a "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "59604242-7cd0-52ac-aae9-ec9a8ac5c0b4"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " permanently attached to it, and the musket's "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "weapon potency",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " rune (and any other runes) applies to Strikes with the stock as well. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "musket staff",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " also contains spells and can be prepared following the same rules as a staff."
          }
        ]
      },
